{
  "displayName": "SYD Agents — Latency, Tokens & Cost",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 12,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "KPI di Riferimento SYD Agents (Target Operativi)",
          "text": {
            "content": "| KPI | Target Verde | Attenzione | Leva di Ottimizzazione |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **TTFT (`chat_ttft_ms`, warm)** | p50 `< 1.5s` / p95 `< 3.0s` | p95 `> 5.0s` | Ridurre `THINKING_LEVEL_*` (`src/core/config.py`) sul router, verificare `session_ms` |\n| **Durata Turno (`chat_total_ms`)** | p95 `< 6.0s` | p95 `> 10.0s` | Ottimizzare tool esterni o rimuovere hop LLM sequenziali |\n| **Prompt Tokens (`chat_prompt_tokens`)** | p50 `< 4k` / p95 `< 10k` | p95 `> 18k` | Abbassare soglia `EventsCompactionConfig` (`src/adk/compaction.py`), snellire prompt |\n| **Cache Hit (`cached / prompt`)** | `> 40%` | `< 20%` | Mantenere prefisso statico invariato in testa al prompt (dati dinamici in coda) |\n| **Thinking Ratio (`thoughts / (thoughts+out)`)** | `< 35%` | `> 55%` | Abbassare `THINKING_LEVEL_*` su router e `triage_agent` |\n| **LLM Calls / Turno (`chat_llm_calls_count`)** | `1.0 – 1.8` | `> 2.5` | Ridurre rimbalzi `syd_orchestrator` ↔ sub-agenti |\n| **Errori (`chat_turn_failed`)** | `< 1%` | `> 3%` | Ispezionare span in Cloud Trace (`chatbotluca-a8a73`) |",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 3,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "title": "TTFT — Time to First Text (p50 / p95, ms)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "legendTemplate": "p50 (cold=${metric.labels.cold_start})",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/chat_ttft_ms\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_PERCENTILE_50",
                      "groupByFields": ["metric.label.cold_start"]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "legendTemplate": "p95 (cold=${metric.labels.cold_start})",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/chat_ttft_ms\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_PERCENTILE_95",
                      "groupByFields": ["metric.label.cold_start"]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              { "label": "Target p95 (3.0s)", "value": 3000 }
            ],
            "yAxis": { "label": "ms", "scale": "LINEAR" }
          }
        }
      },
